Ratio APC300/APC0 STARK excl trace | before vs after | | |\n303\t\n304\t### Correctness verification\n305\t\n306\t```bash\n307\tcargo nextest run -p openvm-cuda-backend --test-threads=4\n308\t```\n309\t\n310\tAll existing tests must pass. The pairing benchmark itself also verifies proof correctness.\n311\t\n312\t## Rollback Criteria\n313\t\n314\t1. **Correctness failure**: Any test failure or proof verification failure → immediate revert.\n315\t2. **Insufficient improvement**: If STARK excl trace for APC 300 improves by less than 100ms (< 4% of ~2,478ms), the optimization is not worth the code change → revert.\n316\t3. **Regression on APC 0**: If APC 0 STARK excl trace regresses by more than 20ms → investigate before committing.\n317\t4. **GPU memory regression**: If physical peak GPU memory increases by more than 50MB (this should not happen given the tiny result buffers, but check `nvidia-smi` during runs) → investigate.\n318\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01QCgGKcrHCjbEXkSGgLC2yp","session_id":"ebef63bf-f161-4614-a323-d6b5d42117d0","uuid":"787d2d00-ba51-4fdc-a19d-c421921a71d3","timestamp":"2026-04-10T17:40:06.708Z"}
